# P7 polish 2: every section tile of a plugin engine's patch editor grid has an icon and a label on Tracker+ (SynthPatchEditor.cpp: the
# sections the stock chain misses take the MK66 rule of synth-open/open_section_icon.h). The card holds pluck.plg and alco.plg (plus_flows.sh
# stages the logos card). Synth 1 steps to ALCO, F8 opens the patch editor on its section grid. plus_flows.sh reads the tiles afterwards
# (UISHOT_TRACE_SYNTHGRID, the synthgrid line): ten tiles, Combine and Sub among them, none without a label or an icon.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Plugin engine section grid on Tracker+ (P7 polish 2)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

use boot-to-pattern
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
use goto-instrument
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth 1"
tap Down x5
wait 1500ms
expect text "ALCO"
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
shot grid-editor
